{
  "notes": "The consumables a raid counts, one list for the site and the addon. supplies is the site's raid-prep catalogue (owner decision D14): the flasks, raid elixirs and buff foods a raid leader counts from the export's supplies= section (api/internal/guilds/raid_prep_catalogue.go copies it into Go, and a guilds test pins the two). protection is the school protection potions an encounter can ask for (encounter_needs.json's consumables name these kinds). The addon gets both as Data.lua's consumables (item id -> kind), counts the bags by kind for the guild snapshot and names what an encounter asks for. Every id and name is a row of the build's simconsumes.json; pipeline/raid_supplies.py refuses one that is not. Flasks: the four Classic raid flasks and Forever's four Natural flasks (Flask of Petrification is a utility flask and is left out). Elixirs: the raid-tier battle and guardian elixirs, the Blasted Lands and Zul'Gurub buffs and Forever's Fortitude and Mageblood elixirs. Food: every item whose spell is Forever's Nutritious Food (the Well Fed rework) at required level 30 or more, the level-1 copies of Tender Wolf Steak and Grilled Squid that share those spells, Dirge's Kickin' Chimaerok Chops and Blessed Sunfruit and its juice.",
